      "content": "<div class=\"pill\">每天 10 分钟</div><h2 class=\"page-title\">4 步完成一次情绪复位</h2><div class=\"timeline\"><article class=\"timeline-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">01</span><div class=\"timeline-copy\"><h3>停下三分钟</h3><p>什么都不做，只做缓慢呼吸。让身体先从警报状态里出来。</p></div><span class=\"step-tag\">STOP</span></article><article class=\"timeline-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">02</span><div class=\"timeline-copy\"><h3>写下此刻的念头</h3><p>不修饰、不评价，全部倒出来。写下来的情绪，才有机会被安放。</p></div><span class=\"step-tag\">WRITE</span></article><article class=\"timeline-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">03</span><div class=\"timeline-copy\"><h3>选一件最小的事去做</h3><p>读 5 页书、走 3000 步、早睡 30 分钟。确定的微小行动能重建掌控感。</p></div><span class=\"step-tag\">ACT</span></article><article class=\"timeline-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">04</span><div class=\"timeline-copy\"><h3>记录下来</h3><p>给今天的情绪打一个分。一个月后，你会看到一条真实的曲线。</p></div><span class=\"step-tag\">LOG</span></article></div>"
